# ABI v1.x — required exported symbols
# ===================================
# Additive-only policy:
#   - This manifest is the exact public mmap_engine_* export set for v1.x.
#   - Missing, renamed, or additional mmap_engine_* symbols → CI FAIL.
#   - Additive ABI changes must update this manifest deliberately.
# Covers v1.0 through v1.x.

mmap_engine_abi_version
mmap_engine_capabilities
mmap_engine_last_error
mmap_engine_open
mmap_engine_scan_chunks
mmap_engine_scan_chunks_ex
mmap_engine_scan_chunks_pattern
mmap_engine_scan_fixed
mmap_engine_partition_records
mmap_engine_get_chunk
mmap_engine_free
